<title>USA: Stokely USA to take Q2 restructure charge.</title>
<headline>Stokely USA to take Q2 restructure charge.</headline>
<dateline>OCONOMOWOC, Wis. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stokely USA Inc said Tuesday it would take a one-time $13.1 million charge to restructure its canned vegetable business.</p>
<p>The company will take the charge against earnings for the second quarter ending September 30.</p>
<p>Stokely plans to close two of its nine vegetable processing facilities while expanding two others.</p>
<p>The moves would reduce Stokely's total employment, which stands at about 540, by about 15 percent.  </p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
